                  "name": "t:names.text",
                  "settings": {
                    "text": "<p>Serge Boutet, Agrologist Expert - Born in Montreal, Canada, Serge Boutet is an agrologist expert in animal nutrition and a McGill University graduate (B.Sc. Animal Science and Executive Development Course Mini-MBA). Serge brings over 35 years of experience to the Smack team as consultant, including the last 29 in the pet food industry, and his unique expertise in nutrition covers a wide range of areas such as pet food formulation, knowledge of ingredients, product development, technical training (teaching), quality control, export, sales, retail, operations and supply chain management. He has also been associated with the Pet Food Forum group and PIJAC Canada as a speaker/moderator for many years.</p>",
